          "text": "Recently,🚆🚛  China's first piggyback transport trial train for highway tanker trucks successfully operated in Shandong Province. 👏 Piggyback transport is a multimodal logistics mode in which entire road vehicles are loaded onto rail wagons, enabling efficient road–rail transfer 🚚➡️🚂. This \"truck-on-train\" approach can significantly reduce logistics costs and carbon emissions 💚. The trial train, consisting of 38 STX-series piggyback railcars co-developed by #CRRC Qiqihar and China Energy Railway Equipment Company transported 6 highway tanker trucks and 64 tank containers.\n#CRRC #RailwayDevelopment #railway #transportation"
        },
